    "summary": "Either Fight Phase, or the Shooting Phase on your opponent’s turn. After an enemy unit finishes attacking, choose a CRYPTEK model of yours destroyed by those attacks. The loss of that model does not prevent this use. For the rest of the battle, your NECRONS models may reroll their Hit rolls against that enemy unit.",
